We were delighted to elect as our new leader Patricia (Pat) Merryweather-Arges, Past Rotary International Board Vice President 2023–2024 and Director 2022–2024.

![Patricia (Pat) Merryweather-Arges](/images/news/pat-merryweather.jpg)

Pat says:

> *"With over 30 years of healthcare experience, I am a mission-driven leader focused on improving health and health care working collaboratively with patients, families, health care clinicians and providers, and legislative bodies in all communities. I accomplish seemingly challenging goals by engaging and leveraging stakeholders in discussion and advocacy. My skill set is dedicated to enhancing the governance structure to ensure successful, measurable outcomes and goals.*
>
> *I am a people-centered leader who excels in executing a shared vision of excellence, prioritizing both outcomes and performance improvement. My approach is centered on being a catalyst for continuous growth while always seeking the next challenging opportunity for achieving goals while empowering other leaders."*

**Contact:** [rotaryhealthprofessionals@gmail.com](mailto:rotaryhealthprofessionals@gmail.com)
